    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cloudbreaker</strong> is a roguelite survivor-like where you explore a sky-world, defeating hordes of enemies. Upgrade and optimize your arsenal with an <strong>inventory management puzzle system</strong>. <strong>Unlock and upgrade airships</strong>, each with its own unique layout, abilities, and strategies, to grow your power over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp;\u00a0Survive:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/6320088cc557001f83195a37b7f77b3b.poster.avif?t=1755088195\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/6320088cc557001f83195a37b7f77b3b.webm?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/6320088cc557001f83195a37b7f77b3b.mp4?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve down through the clouds into a sky-world rife with danger and riches. <strong>Discover</strong>\u00a0<strong>ruins</strong>\u00a0filled with scrap, relics, and resources to power up your ship. <strong>Survive against hordes</strong> of <i>Biotes</i>\u2014the lingering biotech experiments of past civilizations. <strong>Defeat bosses</strong> to gain the power to break through deeper cloud layers and descend deeper into the depths of the sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/880d9582260c8edeb48eae2457d5c283.poster.avif?t=1755088195\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/880d9582260c8edeb48eae2457d5c283.webm?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/880d9582260c8edeb48eae2457d5c283.mp4?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>survive</strong>, you must carefully <strong>upgrade your ship</strong> to contend with increasing dangers as you descend. Defeating <i>Biotes</i> earns you <i>Bloil</i> that your ship converts into <i>Engine Parts</i>. These <i>Engine Parts</i> can be installed in your <i>Engine Grid</i>\u2014an<strong>\u00a0inventory management</strong>\u00a0puzzle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optimize:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placement of<strong>\u00a0</strong><i>Engine Parts</i>\u00a0is key. Each <i>Engine Part</i> interacts with the grid in unique ways, creating <strong>powerful synergies</strong>. This forces you to carefully consider where each new part is installed, and plan your build accordingly. Weapons also have their own <strong>upgrade trees</strong>, redefining how they function, adding another layer of depth to your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrive:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/f110d61d650a1dcce9190da759d9fb96.poster.avif?t=1755088195\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/f110d61d650a1dcce9190da759d9fb96.webm?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/f110d61d650a1dcce9190da759d9fb96.mp4?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power grows over time as you <strong>unlock new parts and airships</strong>. Each ship has its own unique <i>Engine Grid</i> layout, and abilities, that lend themselves to new strategies and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you will customize each ship by powering its upgrade tree, tailoring it to your particular playstyle</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sky-world, discovering ruins and surviving waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management style <i>Engine Grid</i> puzzle system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique <i>Engine Parts</i> that can <strong>combine</strong>\u00a0and <strong>connect to\u00a0</strong>create\u00a0<strong>powerful synergies</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discoverable relics</strong> that change combat, opening up new strategies.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable airships</strong> with unique layouts, and abilities for varied playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade trees</strong> for each ship, enabling deep customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong> and <strong>mini-bosses</strong> that will test your skills and builds.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cloudbreaker</strong> is a roguelite survivor-like where you explore a sky-world, defeating hordes of enemies. Upgrade and optimize your arsenal with an <strong>inventory management puzzle system</strong>. <strong>Unlock and upgrade airships</strong>, each with its own unique layout, abilities, and strategies, to grow your power over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp;\u00a0Survive:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/6320088cc557001f83195a37b7f77b3b.poster.avif?t=1755088195\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/6320088cc557001f83195a37b7f77b3b.webm?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/6320088cc557001f83195a37b7f77b3b.mp4?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve down through the clouds into a sky-world rife with danger and riches. <strong>Discover</strong>\u00a0<strong>ruins</strong>\u00a0filled with scrap, relics, and resources to power up your ship. <strong>Survive against hordes</strong> of <i>Biotes</i>\u2014the lingering biotech experiments of past civilizations. <strong>Defeat bosses</strong> to gain the power to break through deeper cloud layers and descend deeper into the depths of the sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/880d9582260c8edeb48eae2457d5c283.poster.avif?t=1755088195\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/880d9582260c8edeb48eae2457d5c283.webm?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/880d9582260c8edeb48eae2457d5c283.mp4?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>survive</strong>, you must carefully <strong>upgrade your ship</strong> to contend with increasing dangers as you descend. Defeating <i>Biotes</i> earns you <i>Bloil</i> that your ship converts into <i>Engine Parts</i>. These <i>Engine Parts</i> can be installed in your <i>Engine Grid</i>\u2014an<strong>\u00a0inventory management</strong>\u00a0puzzle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optimize:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placement of<strong>\u00a0</strong><i>Engine Parts</i>\u00a0is key. Each <i>Engine Part</i> interacts with the grid in unique ways, creating <strong>powerful synergies</strong>. This forces you to carefully consider where each new part is installed, and plan your build accordingly. Weapons also have their own <strong>upgrade trees</strong>, redefining how they function, adding another layer of depth to your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrive:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/f110d61d650a1dcce9190da759d9fb96.poster.avif?t=1755088195\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/f110d61d650a1dcce9190da759d9fb96.webm?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/f110d61d650a1dcce9190da759d9fb96.mp4?t=1755088195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></spa